{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03199","headline":"和崔司空伤姬人 · 杨炯","name":"和崔司空伤姬人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时南浦别，鹤怨宝琴弦。\n今日东方至，鸾销珠镜前。\n水流衔砌咽，月影向窗悬。\n妆匣凄余粉，熏炉灭旧烟。\n晚庭摧玉树，寒帐委金莲。\n佳人不再得，云日几千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}